
@startuml er-diagram
title attendance_qr: Модели мантиқии пойгоҳи додаҳо

hide circle
skinparam linetype ortho
skinparam entity {
    BackgroundColor #EAF2F8
    BorderColor #2874A6
}

entity groups {
  * id : INT <<PK>>
  --
  * name : VARCHAR(50) <<UQ>>
  * course : INT
  * faculty : VARCHAR(150)
}

entity users {
  * id : INT <<PK>>
  --
  group_id : INT <<FK>>
  * full_name : VARCHAR(150)
  * username : VARCHAR(50) <<UQ>>
  * password_hash : VARCHAR(255)
  * role : ENUM
  * is_active : TINYINT(1)
  * created_at : DATETIME
}

entity subjects {
  * id : INT <<PK>>
  --
  * name : VARCHAR(150) <<UQ>>
  description : TEXT
}

entity lessons {
  * id : INT <<PK>>
  --
  * group_id : INT <<FK>>
  * subject_id : INT <<FK>>
  * teacher_id : INT <<FK>>
  * lesson_date : DATE
  * start_time : TIME
  * end_time : TIME
  * status : ENUM
}

entity qr_tokens {
  * id : INT <<PK>>
  --
  * lesson_id : INT <<FK>>
  * token : VARCHAR(255) <<UQ>>
  * created_at : DATETIME
  * expires_at : DATETIME
}

entity attendance {
  * id : INT <<PK>>
  --
  * student_id : INT <<FK>>
  * lesson_id : INT <<FK>>
  * qr_token_id : INT <<FK>>
  * status : ENUM
  * attendance_time : DATETIME
  --
  UNIQUE(student_id, lesson_id)
}

groups |o--o{ users : group_id
groups ||--o{ lessons : group_id
subjects ||--o{ lessons : subject_id
users ||--o{ lessons : teacher_id
lessons ||--o{ qr_tokens : lesson_id
users ||--o{ attendance : student_id
lessons ||--o{ attendance : lesson_id
qr_tokens ||--o{ attendance : qr_token_id

note right of qr_tokens
  QR token ҳар 30 сония нав мешавад.
  expires_at вақти анҷоми эътиборро нишон медиҳад.
end note

note bottom of attendance
  Ҷадвали пайвасткунанда барои алоқаи M:N
  байни донишҷӯён ва дарсҳо.
end note

@enduml
